  "display_title": "Awaiting My 7th Marriage",
  "description": "As the heir to the ultra-powerful Noblisse family, Agatha has been a pawn in the emperor’s political game her whole life. He had her married off, not just once or twice, but six times! After her most recent matrimonial fiasco, Agatha seizes the chance to take control of her destiny and choose her next husband herself. Handsome, powerful, and a war hero, Enoch Aratus couldn’t be more perfect for the job. But nothing disrupts a political marriage faster than actually falling for your husband…\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
